  },
  "priority": 8,
  "consumesTurn": true,
  "location": "classroom",
  "bgm": "main_bgm",
  "scenes": [
    {
      "id": "s1",
      "text": "昼休みの教室。エミリが半泣きでアオイにすがりついていた。",
      "avatars": {
        "emili": {
          "position": "left",
          "expression": "sad",
          "motion": "ardy_beg"
        },
        "aoi": {
          "position": "right",
          "expression": "happy"
        }
      },
      "camera": "wide",
      "setFlags": {
        "blazer_swapped": true
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s2",
      "speaker": "エミリ",
      "speakerCharacterId": "emili",
      "text": "アオイちゃ〜ん！ 助けて〜！ 廊下走ってたら、ブレザーのボタンがポーンって飛んでっちゃったの〜！",
      "voiceUrl": "v_s2_fee81d2a.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s3",
      "speaker": "アオイ",
      "speakerCharacterId": "aoi",
      "text": "あらら。私、裁縫セット持ってるから、縫ってあげるよ。",
      "avatars": {
        "aoi": {
          "expression": "happy"
        }
      },
      "voiceUrl": "v_s3_00146b46.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s4",
      "speaker": "エミリ",
      "speakerCharacterId": "emili",
      "text": "ほんと！？ ありがと〜！ じゃあ直してもらう間、アオイちゃんのブレザー貸して！",
      "avatars": {
        "emili": {
          "expression": "happy"
        }
      },
      "voiceUrl": "v_s4_da462515.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s5",
      "speaker": "アオイ",
      "speakerCharacterId": "aoi",
      "text": "うん、いいよ。はい、どうぞ。",
      "avatars": {
        "aoi": {
          "expression": "happy"
        }
      },
      "voiceUrl": "v_s5_65927161.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s6",
      "text": "二人はブレザーを交換した。エミリはアオイのブレザーを。アオイは、胸に金糸のエンブレムが入ったエミリの特注ブレザーを。"
    },
    {
      "id": "s7",
      "speaker": "エミリ",
      "speakerCharacterId": "emili",
      "text": "わ、アオイちゃんのブレザー、いい匂い〜。",
      "avatars": {
        "emili": {
          "expression": "relaxed"
        }
      },
      "voiceUrl": "v_s7_b52f57a5.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s8",
      "speaker": "アオイ",
      "speakerCharacterId": "aoi",
      "text": "エミリちゃんのは、なんだか重たいね……。この刺繍、本物の金？",
      "avatars": {
        "aoi": {
          "expression": "surprised"
        }
      },
      "voiceUrl": "v_s8_beb6ad23.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s9",
      "speaker": "エミリ",
      "speakerCharacterId": "emili",
      "text": "うん。パパが「エミリの目印だ」って。変でしょ〜。",
      "avatars": {
        "emili": {
          "expression": "happy"
        }
      },
      "voiceUrl": "v_s9_6414652f.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s10",
      "text": "",
      "camera": "wide",
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "c1_1",
          "text": "「アオイ、そのブレザーも似合ってるな」",
          "goto": "a",
          "addAffinity": {
            "aoi": 1
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "c1_2",
          "text": "「……目印？」と引っかかる",
          "goto": "b",
          "setFlags": {
            "noticed_emblem": true
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "a",
      "speaker": "アオイ",
      "speakerCharacterId": "aoi",
      "text": "え、そ、そうかな……。えへへ、なんだかお嬢様になった気分。",
      "avatars": {
        "aoi": {
          "expression": "happy",
          "motion": "ardy_shy_cover",
          "motionLoop": true
        }
      },
      "nextSceneId": "end",
      "voiceUrl": "v_a_e3a728b7.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "b",
      "speaker": "エミリ",
      "speakerCharacterId": "emili",
      "text": "うん、目印。パパの部下の人たち、私をこのエンブレムで見分けてるんだって。",
      "avatars": {
        "emili": {
          "expression": "relaxed"
        }
      },
      "voiceUrl": "v_b_8b0bf571.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s13",
      "speaker": "タカシ",
      "text": "（……それ、今アオイが着てるんだけど、大丈夫か？）"
    },
    {
      "id": "end",
      "text": "アオイの修繕作業は、少し時間がかかりそうだった。ブレザーは、しばらく交換したままだ。"
    },
    {
      "id": "s15",
      "text": "――これが、のちの大騒動の引き金になるとも知らずに。"
    }
  ]
}
